<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

    <div class="row mt-4 mb-5">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-8 offset-md-2">
            <h3>Privacy Policy</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">Last updated: November 2026</p>
            <p>Wanderlust stores the information you give us so the site can work: your username, email address, a securely hashed password, and the listings and reviews you post.</p>
            <p>We use a session cookie to keep you logged in. We do not sell your personal data. Images you upload are stored with our image hosting provider (Cloudinary), and location lookups use Mapbox.</p>
            <p>You can delete your own listings and reviews at any time. To request removal of your account, contact the site owner.</p>
        </div>
    </div>